                <mxCell id="cLTDNrwRSgNNsfePn7-a-40" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Agentic Solution for Trip Management&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Users will be allowed to manage and build their Itineraries from different or various source booking into one single portal. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Users will be share their Itineraries with their friends and families. Build a checklist of the items they plan to organize on the trips.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
